B.ame=new A.F9("4. How to Contact Us","If you believe you have been charged in error or have questions regarding your billing, please contact our support team at:\n\nEmail: app.nookly@gmail.com\n\nResponse Time: We aim to respond to all billing inquiries within 3\u20135 business days.",null)
B.amf=new A.F9("1. Subscription Cancellation","You may cancel your Nookly Premium subscription at any time. Please note that:\n\n- Self-Service Cancellation: Cancellations must be managed through the platform where the purchase was made (e.g., Google Play Store, Apple App Store, or directly via our Web App settings).\n- Access Period: Upon cancellation, you will continue to have access to the premium features until the end of your current billing cycle.\n- No Partial Credits: We do not offer prorated refunds or credits for any unused portion of a subscription period.",null)
